  "project_description": "This module add some enhancements for Drupal Core's Layout Builder.\n\n Back to top \n\n Features \n \n View Block : A view block with automatic offset calculation to place views items flexible into a Layout Builder Grid \n Layout builder preview : Add a new view mode for blocks with a complex layout to show a preview in layout builder.\n \n \n Back to top \n\n Requirements \n \n Layout Builder (Drupal Core) \n\n \n Back to top \n\n Recommended Modules \n \n Layout Builder Restrictions \n\n \n Back to top \n\n Configuration\n\n Preview \n\nConfigure preview display for desired block types.\n\n View Block \n\nAdd a new embed view\nA new block for layout builder should be appear\n\n Back to top",
